  "bio": "Dayna Ramoz is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for her exquisite minimalist style, located in the sun-kissed city of Cabo San Lucas, Mexico. Her finesse with fine lines transforms simple concepts into captivating, elegant body art. Clients appreciate Dayna's clean and professional approach, ensuring every tattoo experience is of the highest standard, from design to execution.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur, Mexico\n\n𝑳𝒐𝒔 𝑪𝒂𝒃𝒐𝒔, 𝑩𝑪𝑺 🌴☀️ \n𝑨 𝒗𝒆𝒄𝒆𝒔 𝒕𝒂𝒕𝒖𝒐🔥🌟\n𝑭𝒊𝒏𝒆 𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒆🧚🏼‍♀️\n𝑵𝑶 𝒇𝒊𝒍𝒕𝒓𝒐𝒔, 𝑵𝑶 𝒄𝒐𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒖𝒑💫",
